{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把原稿中盼着对方也喜欢自己不再小心收着的样子，弱化成希望对方接受自己更坦率的在意。前者包含期待对方 reciprocate（也喜欢自己）的意思，后者只是希望得到接纳，少了相互喜欢这一层。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。把忘了藏好喜欢概括为喜欢全部露出，程度略有强化，但没有改变这屏的核心处境和原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了安静时他虽然还想靠近，却害怕自己要得太多这一层矛盾。原稿不只是安心之后渴望更多亲近，也包含对自身需求过多的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把这屏说成第一次认真期待两个人有更长久的以后，不符合时间顺序。S07已经出现盼着以后能一直陪在对方身边的愿望；S08是看到对方依然亲近后，进一步敢于主动回应，并开始期待两个人还能好很久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把担心对方以后连和自己待着都不自在，改成担心对方不再喜欢和自己待在一起。前者重点是相处的自在与亲近可能消失，后者则偏向对方不再喜欢自己，含义有所偏移。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"原稿说即使对方不需要他，他仍然愿意陪着对方；观众概括成需要未必永远相互，弱化了即使完全得不到对方需要也仍愿意陪伴的意思。另外，一直陪伴比原稿表达的愿意陪着更绝对。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"整体处境和原因都对，但把感受概括为满足不够准确。原稿强调的是明知不够、仍想多陪一会儿，像渴极了却仍解不了渴，是热烈、急切、近乎无法满足的喜欢，而不是已经获得满足的安稳幸福。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事主线拼得非常准确：从害怕自己的需要成为负担，到逐渐相信亲近可能是相互的，再到主动给予陪伴、坦然表达喜欢，最后接受未来的不确定而不再隐藏、不再强求保证；局部有几处对相互喜欢、相处不自在和陪伴意愿的细节偏移，但没有改变整个故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4fa9dca3-ff6e-477f-84e2-07504f584b00", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T203357666250Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:36:10.573818+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9198ca83fe435943bcecdd9872b29220f555e4fd22ea87a3e0ddee0bded5a087", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T203357666250Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bd4bdc56bdce27f807f3695351e763d688c7f32100baa50d6c3ff84ebed07c8c"}}}
